\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces HA-Expert-Bench results by configuration (240 questions; graded $n$ per Section~\ref {sec:experiments}). (a) Overall: fine-tuning doubles the base model (0.300 $\rightarrow $ 0.601); retrieval alone is worth more (0.710); the two do not compose additively (0.662). (b) By type: retrieval's largest effect is on traps (0.267 $\rightarrow $ 0.867); best quantitative: combined cell (0.550). Colors match Figure~\ref {fig:failures}.}}{7}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:results}{{2}{7}{HA-Expert-Bench results by configuration (240 questions; graded $n$ per Section~\ref {sec:experiments}). (a) Overall: fine-tuning doubles the base model (0.300 $\rightarrow $ 0.601); retrieval alone is worth more (0.710); the two do not compose additively (0.662). (b) By type: retrieval's largest effect is on traps (0.267 $\rightarrow $ 0.867); best quantitative: combined cell (0.550). Colors match Figure~\ref {fig:failures}}{figure.2}{}}
