\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Failure-mode counts per configuration (240 responses each, greedy decoding). \emph  {Heavy repetition}: a 30-character block repeated at least $5\times $ in one response. Self-generated fine-tuning data more than triples the base count (10 $\rightarrow $ 35): the teacher's habit, distilled; retrieval lowers both counts. The annotation marks Mechanism 1's 5 citation-marker loops (DAPT+SFT+RAG only).}}{8}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:failures}{{3}{8}{Failure-mode counts per configuration (240 responses each, greedy decoding). \emph {Heavy repetition}: a 30-character block repeated at least $5\times $ in one response. Self-generated fine-tuning data more than triples the base count (10 $\rightarrow $ 35): the teacher's habit, distilled; retrieval lowers both counts. The annotation marks Mechanism 1's 5 citation-marker loops (DAPT+SFT+RAG only)}{figure.3}{}}
