\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Per-question verdicts on the 15 trap items, questions shown verbatim. Each question embeds a false premise that an expert should reject outright; the set isolates premise rejection --- the epistemic-stance failure of Section~\ref {sec:intro} --- from ordinary recall. Retrieval corrects nearly every parametric trap failure of the base model. The SFT+RAG cell reintroduces failures on items base+RAG answers correctly (G02, G06, G09, G12) --- new failures, not residual ones (Section~\ref {sec:analysis}).}}{10}{table.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:traps}{{5}{10}{Per-question verdicts on the 15 trap items, questions shown verbatim. Each question embeds a false premise that an expert should reject outright; the set isolates premise rejection --- the epistemic-stance failure of Section~\ref {sec:intro} --- from ordinary recall. Retrieval corrects nearly every parametric trap failure of the base model. The SFT+RAG cell reintroduces failures on items base+RAG answers correctly (G02, G06, G09, G12) --- new failures, not residual ones (Section~\ref {sec:analysis})}{table.5}{}}
